  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your emotions rarely get in the way when you are raging, and never for long.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Resolute Rager<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat to any emotion-affecting effect, not just fear; however, you gain a bonus equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on your new saves to end fear effects affecting you. By spending one use of your mythic power, you can gain the effects of resist fear for a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-rage-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
